5% of developers using TS monthly, while JavaScript remains universal as the runtime. npm installs for typescript grew by roughly an order of magnitude since 2017.\n\n  * 1 file\n  * 0 forks\n  * 0 comments\n  * 0 stars\n\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n2025-11-12 English Towns without a Wetherspoons, full list https://gist.github.com/amandasaurus/ef012e3b68113e4eae0479747a6600f2 · GitHub (https://gist.github.com/amandasaurus/5bfd8f9e759f23974b16c135a8fd782f)\nciteturn1909search7 [wordlim: 200] Published: 10 months ago; Crawled: 3 days ago; Created November 12, 2025 13:422025-11-12 English Towns without a Wetherspoons, full list https://gist.github.com/amandasaurus/ef012e3b68113e4eae0479747a6600f2\n\n# amandasaurus/towns_wo_spoons.md\n\nCreated November 12, 2025 13:42\n\n2025-11-12 English Towns without a Wetherspoons, full list https://gist.github.com/amandasaurus/ef012e3b68113e4eae0479747a6600f2\n\nPlacename  | population  | Distance to Wetherspoons (km)  | Wetherspoons name\n--- | --- | --- | ---\nStow-on-the-Wold  | unknown  | 29  | The Golden Bee\nMoreton-in-Marsh  | unknown  | 22  | The Golden Bee\nCirencester  | unknown  | 21  | The Moon Under Water\nMarket Rasen  | unknown  | 21  | The White Horse\nNorton-on-Derwent  | unknown  | 27  | The Postern Gate\nBerwick-upon-Tweed  | 12043  | 70  | The Electrical Wizard\nWadebridge  | 7900  | 20  | The Rann Wartha\nCamelford  | unknown  | 24  | The King Doniert\nStratton  | 2272  | 30  | The Rose Salterne\nBude  | 7342  | 42  | The King Doniert\nSpilsby  | unknown  | 22  | The Joseph Morton\nWoodhall Spa  | unknown  | 21  | The Packhorse Inn\nHugh Town  | 1100  | 60  | The Tremenheere\nHolsworthy  | 2641  | 25  | The Rose Salterne\nLaunceston  | 7135  | 22  | The King Doniert\nLakenheath  | unknown  | 21  | The Golden Lion\nSwaffham  | 7258  | 23  | The Limes\nSaxmundham  | unknown  | 28  | The Kings Head Hotel\nDiss  | 7500  | 23  | The Willow Tree\nSheringham  |